WEBVTT

01:40.400 --> 01:45.729
[Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

01:46.340 --> 01:50.780
[Episode 23]

01:52.120 --> 01:52.950
Master.

01:58.940 --> 01:59.900
Master, look.

02:00.470 --> 02:01.680
In order to get that flower,

02:01.680 --> 02:03.710
our Drunken Dream Tower has already suffered countless casualties.

02:03.710 --> 02:05.640
Then let's organize a Demon Fight.

02:05.680 --> 02:07.540
Go out and find some new recruits.

02:08.030 --> 02:09.190
No matter what,

02:09.590 --> 02:11.120
I want the Twilight Mist Flower.

02:11.120 --> 02:12.030
Yes, Master.

02:12.800 --> 02:15.560
I told you to find Wangquan Hongye's whereabouts.

02:15.560 --> 02:17.500
Why is there still no news?

02:18.120 --> 02:19.570
We have sent out all spies.

02:19.570 --> 02:21.630
Please wait a little longer, Master.

02:21.710 --> 02:22.970
But even if we find him,

02:23.310 --> 02:25.590
we do not have the skills to kill him.

02:26.900 --> 02:28.920
Of course you guys can't kill him.

02:29.430 --> 02:31.030
But there is someone who can.

02:31.910 --> 02:33.110
Go find them quickly.

02:33.680 --> 02:34.590
Yes, Master.

02:48.390 --> 02:49.870
There are assassins!

02:51.540 --> 02:52.760
Who are you?

03:15.450 --> 03:16.120
Let's go.

03:38.430 --> 03:39.520
Ms. Qingmu?

03:43.980 --> 03:44.960
Master Zhang.

03:45.870 --> 03:46.800
Long time no see.

03:47.460 --> 03:48.790
I hope you've been well.

03:49.550 --> 03:50.460
Speak.

03:51.630 --> 03:52.800
What are you doing here?

03:52.800 --> 03:54.800
I should be asking you that instead.

03:55.430 --> 03:57.710
You've visited Beast Kingdom three times in the past month.

03:57.710 --> 03:59.170
What exactly are you up to?

03:59.630 --> 04:00.690
I go where I please.

04:01.910 --> 04:02.870
Wherever I go,

04:03.960 --> 04:05.490
it's none of your business.

04:06.590 --> 04:09.150
Beast Kingdom is holding a nationwide search for Wangquan Hongye.

04:09.150 --> 04:10.120
Was it you

04:10.150 --> 04:12.950
who leaked this information to Beast Kingdom's ruler?

04:12.950 --> 04:15.010
So Wangquan Hongye has come here too.

04:15.650 --> 04:17.380
Then why are you questioning me

04:17.730 --> 04:19.329
instead of confronting him?

04:20.680 --> 04:22.800
Why are you avoiding my questions?

04:26.780 --> 04:27.990
Could it be that...

04:28.180 --> 04:30.830
you've been in contact with Beast Kingdom for a long time now,

04:30.830 --> 04:32.560
plotting something sinister?

04:33.540 --> 04:34.340
What's wrong?

04:34.930 --> 04:36.270
Did I get it right?

04:36.630 --> 04:38.030
Do you want to silence me?

04:43.040 --> 04:43.750
Let go.

04:44.210 --> 04:46.270
There are some things I must clarify.

04:46.680 --> 04:48.920
Why did you change so drastically after turning 18

04:48.920 --> 04:50.060
and refuse to see me ever again?

04:50.060 --> 04:52.320
What exactly happened during that time?

04:56.300 --> 04:57.270
Say something!

04:58.710 --> 04:59.659
Speak up!

05:10.000 --> 05:11.660
What we can be certain of now is

05:12.190 --> 05:14.360
those demons bought at a high price by Drunken Dream Tower's owner

05:14.360 --> 05:16.360
have all been sent to retrieve the Twilight Mist Flower.

05:16.360 --> 05:17.490
None have returned.

05:18.120 --> 05:20.720
This Demon Fight also serves the same purpose.

05:21.490 --> 05:23.190
And the assassin who tried to kill you

05:23.190 --> 05:25.450
was also instructed by this tower owner.

05:26.310 --> 05:27.640
Hongye, Mrs. Wangquan.

05:28.630 --> 05:29.750
While you were at Drunken Dream Tower,

05:29.750 --> 05:31.070
news came from Ruyi Pavilion.

05:31.070 --> 05:34.270
They said the owner of Drunken Dream Tower has been found.

05:35.870 --> 05:38.670
It's the new National Preceptor of Beast Kingdom,

05:38.800 --> 05:39.560
Anayan.

05:43.409 --> 05:45.070
National Preceptor, Anayan?

05:45.190 --> 05:47.920
She also wants to obtain the Twilight Mist Flower

05:48.310 --> 05:50.040
and sent an assassin to kill me.

05:50.750 --> 05:52.610
The assassin was also sent by her?

05:52.750 --> 05:55.800
Hongye, let's go to the National Preceptor's Residence to meet her now.

05:55.800 --> 05:57.060
That might alert them.

05:58.430 --> 06:01.470
They've sent many spies, searching for you throughout the city.

06:01.470 --> 06:03.470
We can root out this assassin first.

06:04.700 --> 06:05.700
That makes sense.

06:07.310 --> 06:08.370
How will we do that?

06:08.560 --> 06:10.360
By turning the bait on the spies.

06:19.410 --> 06:20.810
Why are you following me?

06:28.630 --> 06:30.560
Actually, I'm not afraid of wolves

06:30.620 --> 06:32.020
nor am I afraid of demons.

06:32.830 --> 06:34.830
I'm just a little afraid of the dark.

06:39.390 --> 06:40.450
Afraid of the dark?

06:41.430 --> 06:42.360
Then make a fire.

06:54.070 --> 06:54.870
What's wrong?

06:59.970 --> 07:02.760
My leg... I think it's injured.

07:12.230 --> 07:13.290
What are you doing?

07:21.870 --> 07:25.920
Before I kill you, I want to know the whole truth.

07:44.270 --> 07:45.210
Who are you?

07:46.710 --> 07:47.630
Zhang Zheng.

07:48.190 --> 07:49.870
I'm asking for your real name.

07:54.390 --> 07:55.120
Speak.

08:00.630 --> 08:01.510
A... Na...

08:04.720 --> 08:05.450
Ran.

08:06.240 --> 08:07.160
So...

08:10.720 --> 08:12.380
So you are really a body double

08:12.720 --> 08:15.050
Master Zhang bought for the Young Master.

08:15.270 --> 08:16.730
Because you and him...

08:17.870 --> 08:19.320
look exactly the same.

08:19.720 --> 08:20.510
Yes.

08:22.560 --> 08:24.690
Were you the one who stole his identity

08:25.510 --> 08:27.770
and fooled everyone in the Zhang family?

08:29.560 --> 08:30.360
Yes.

08:32.039 --> 08:33.370
What about Zhang Zheng?

08:33.840 --> 08:34.789
Where is he?

08:39.000 --> 08:40.000
Dead.

08:44.870 --> 08:45.790
Was it you...

08:47.080 --> 08:48.080
who killed him?

08:52.030 --> 08:53.320
Yes, I killed him.

08:55.870 --> 08:57.630
He was such a good person.

08:58.670 --> 09:00.080
How could you kill him?

09:01.510 --> 09:02.670
I'm going to kill you!

09:02.670 --> 09:03.840
Go ahead, kill me.

09:08.060 --> 09:09.490
I'm already exhausted.

09:14.750 --> 09:15.630
Yuan,

09:17.700 --> 09:18.630
I'm sorry.

09:20.290 --> 09:22.420
I can't walk you home at night anymore.

09:35.690 --> 09:36.900
Miss Qingmu,

09:37.270 --> 09:38.400
I'm here to save you.

09:41.910 --> 09:42.700
It was you.

09:46.690 --> 09:49.550
It was you who led me out of the nightmare formation.

09:58.720 --> 10:01.050
I want to hear your story with Zhang Zheng.

10:03.020 --> 10:06.540
What exactly happened between you two?

10:08.110 --> 10:09.240
Our Young Master...

10:14.150 --> 10:16.630
He was a very, very nice person.

10:19.870 --> 10:21.000
A little to the left.

10:22.390 --> 10:23.790
Yes, right there.

10:28.490 --> 10:30.350
I heard that at the academy today,

10:31.000 --> 10:32.930
Yuan was caught knocking off again

10:33.600 --> 10:35.660
and got punished with copying books.

10:36.390 --> 10:37.380
But don't worry, Young Master,

10:37.380 --> 10:39.440
I helped her copy more than half of it.

10:40.270 --> 10:42.580
She doesn't like to move much,

10:43.400 --> 10:45.000
but she has a great appetite.

10:45.630 --> 10:47.750
Today, she actually ate four mooncakes.

10:47.750 --> 10:49.030
She actually ate four?

10:49.230 --> 10:51.150
You really understand her, Young Master.

10:51.150 --> 10:53.060
She doesn't like fancy delicacies,

10:53.060 --> 10:56.190
but loves the five-nut mooncakes from Lao Wu Ji the most.

10:58.070 --> 11:00.610
Why didn't you stay with her longer before coming back?

11:00.610 --> 11:02.010
She's afraid of the dark.

11:02.270 --> 11:04.390
I stayed with her at the academy until she finished her punishment.

11:04.390 --> 11:06.390
I've also made sure to send her home.

11:07.080 --> 11:07.410
Come.

11:09.060 --> 11:10.030
That's good.

11:11.560 --> 11:12.970
Yuan has grown up too.

11:14.560 --> 11:15.910
Miss Qingmu.

11:16.670 --> 11:19.400
She'll soon be the new mistress of Ruyi Pavilion.

11:27.500 --> 11:32.320
Young Master, you will surely be able to spend the Mid-Autumn Festival with her next year.

11:32.320 --> 11:33.120
Me?

11:39.570 --> 11:41.970
I won't make it through this winter, will I?

11:43.510 --> 11:44.510
All these years,

11:46.150 --> 11:48.480
thank you for testing the medicine for me,

11:48.750 --> 11:50.280
for appearing on my behalf,

11:51.070 --> 11:52.000
for visiting...

11:55.730 --> 11:56.730
Yuan on my behalf.

12:12.590 --> 12:13.770
If I die,

12:17.900 --> 12:19.600
you will certainly be erased.

12:22.630 --> 12:23.630
I could run away.

12:24.320 --> 12:26.520
I've seen you practice swordsmanship.

12:26.750 --> 12:28.350
Your talent is astonishing.

12:29.270 --> 12:30.400
If you wanted to run,

12:30.720 --> 12:32.450
you could have done so long ago.

12:33.080 --> 12:34.280
Why didn't you leave?

12:42.500 --> 12:44.630
Although you're a person of few words,

12:45.000 --> 12:46.610
you have a soft heart.

12:49.340 --> 12:50.790
You stayed for me.

12:55.670 --> 12:56.600
So...

12:59.270 --> 13:00.240
So I also...

13:08.390 --> 13:10.450
So I also want to do something for you.

13:13.040 --> 13:15.640
There's a new bottle of medicine in the drawer.

13:16.610 --> 13:17.680
Go get it.

13:29.540 --> 13:30.170
Come.

13:31.940 --> 13:32.910
Pour it all out.

13:39.750 --> 13:40.270
Water.

13:59.980 --> 14:00.620
I'm tired.

14:08.090 --> 14:10.620
I left you some mooncakes on the table.

14:11.270 --> 14:12.530
Salted ham mooncakes.

14:14.280 --> 14:16.140
I remember you don't like sweets.

15:02.990 --> 15:04.990
On that Mid-Autumn Festival night,

15:05.980 --> 15:07.710
he took Yusu pills.

15:10.560 --> 15:13.490
It's a medicine that can bring on a last burst of life,

15:15.160 --> 15:17.020
but will accelerate his death.

15:20.640 --> 15:22.590
He wanted to give me the identity

15:24.450 --> 15:25.510
of Zhang Zheng.

15:32.210 --> 15:33.010
Young Master.

15:43.850 --> 15:46.270
Is it the medication from last time that's working?

15:46.270 --> 15:49.530
Young Master, you can get out of bed now. That's wonderful!

15:51.520 --> 15:52.550
I had someone specially buy

15:52.550 --> 15:54.750
the medicine I took during Mid-Autumn.

15:54.960 --> 15:56.090
It's the Yusu pills.

15:56.770 --> 15:59.030
It can give me an immediate burst of life,

15:59.370 --> 16:02.100
allowing me to move and walk like a normal person.

16:05.550 --> 16:07.350
But it will accelerate my death.

16:11.690 --> 16:13.520
Young Master, why are you doing this?

16:13.520 --> 16:14.590
Because I think...

16:16.750 --> 16:19.680
you are more suitable to be Dark Sword's Zhang Zheng.

16:22.310 --> 16:25.910
Since childhood, I've vowed to become an exceptional swordsman

16:26.280 --> 16:28.540
and carry on the legacy of the Dark Sword.

16:30.600 --> 16:34.060
I was once the strongest young swordsman in the Yiqi Alliance.

17:07.730 --> 17:08.530
Young Master!

17:08.690 --> 17:09.450
Stop!

17:13.030 --> 17:13.890
How did you find

17:15.829 --> 17:16.829
my swordmanship?

17:17.510 --> 17:18.349
It was great.

17:21.530 --> 17:22.530
That's good then.

17:24.200 --> 17:25.319
From today on,

17:27.849 --> 17:28.980
I will be you.

17:30.190 --> 17:31.720
You shall stay in this room.

17:31.840 --> 17:33.710
I have about 10 days.

17:33.840 --> 17:34.940
During this time,

17:35.640 --> 17:37.070
you need to gradually transition from

17:37.070 --> 17:39.470
being bedridden to a miraculous recovery.

17:39.680 --> 17:40.610
Young Master...

17:40.880 --> 17:41.960
Let's exchange clothes.

17:41.960 --> 17:42.760
Young Master!

17:51.400 --> 17:53.330
I've already taken the Yusu pills.

17:54.100 --> 17:55.700
There's no turning back now.

17:59.230 --> 18:00.200
It's alright.

18:02.240 --> 18:04.170
I have many unfulfilled ambitions

18:06.330 --> 18:08.090
and many regrets.

18:09.200 --> 18:10.240
But at least

18:10.430 --> 18:12.230
I'm not dying full of resentment

18:12.510 --> 18:13.960
on a sickbed.

18:17.590 --> 18:18.350
At least...

18:20.350 --> 18:21.350
your life

18:23.830 --> 18:25.000
can continue.

18:28.630 --> 18:29.490
Take the sword.

19:10.750 --> 19:11.590
So...

19:13.130 --> 19:15.790
he voluntarily exchanged identities with you?

19:17.070 --> 19:19.000
Then why did you say you killed him?

19:20.080 --> 19:21.670
He died because of me.

19:25.200 --> 19:26.680
I killed him.

19:50.830 --> 19:51.640
Who's there?

20:01.300 --> 20:02.550
Greetings, Young Master.

20:02.550 --> 20:03.110
Go away!

20:03.720 --> 20:04.350
Young Master.

20:04.350 --> 20:06.370
This is on the orders of our Master.

20:06.390 --> 20:07.960
Please don't put us in a difficult position.

20:07.960 --> 20:09.270
I need to speak with him for a moment.

20:09.270 --> 20:10.890
But, Young Master...

20:10.920 --> 20:11.750
Go away!

20:11.920 --> 20:12.720
Yes.

20:35.320 --> 20:36.410
I'm sorry.

20:37.960 --> 20:39.490
They dragged me here before

20:40.490 --> 20:42.350
I could even wait for your return.

20:42.500 --> 20:43.760
Don't draw your sword.

20:44.840 --> 20:46.300
I got what I wanted.

20:48.780 --> 20:50.440
This is the outcome I desired.

21:00.450 --> 21:02.330
I'm already at the end of my rope.

21:04.950 --> 21:06.190
You know that.

21:06.310 --> 21:07.310
You can't do this.

21:12.470 --> 21:14.800
After taking the Yusu pills,

21:15.400 --> 21:17.110
do you know how much pain I had to endure every day

21:17.110 --> 21:18.570
just to make it to this day?

21:20.350 --> 21:22.480
Do you want all my efforts to be in vain?

21:24.240 --> 21:25.300
Being buried alive

21:26.440 --> 21:27.590
is very painful.

21:28.060 --> 21:29.320
I really can't do this.

21:35.050 --> 21:37.250
Dying from the effects of the Yusu pills

21:38.850 --> 21:41.180
is a hundred times more painful than this.

21:41.200 --> 21:43.250
Why do you never give me a choice?

21:43.270 --> 21:44.960
Give me a chance to stop you.

21:46.690 --> 21:48.140
Because I hope...

21:50.560 --> 21:52.540
that all of this is my own choice.

21:54.410 --> 21:56.030
It has nothing to do with you.

21:57.160 --> 21:58.680
Don't feel guilty.

22:01.310 --> 22:04.830
I hope you can live well.

22:16.990 --> 22:19.920
This is a charm I've carried with me since childhood.

22:21.920 --> 22:23.590
I was always hesitating on

22:24.510 --> 22:26.490
what I should carve for you.

22:27.700 --> 22:29.500
I almost couldn't give it to you.

22:35.020 --> 22:36.030
It's a clivia.

22:39.100 --> 22:40.690
It's not well-carved.

22:56.500 --> 22:57.910
From today on,

23:00.390 --> 23:02.250
you are Dark Sword's Zhang Zheng.

23:03.920 --> 23:05.680
Take good care of my clivia.

23:08.510 --> 23:09.960
Take care of yourself.

23:14.270 --> 23:15.930
Take care of the Zhang family.

23:26.070 --> 23:27.480
Let go.

23:28.960 --> 23:30.400
Do you want all my efforts

23:30.400 --> 23:31.550
to be in vain?

23:42.110 --> 23:44.310
If you insist on feeling indebted to me,

23:47.760 --> 23:48.960
living your life well

23:50.850 --> 23:52.980
is the only repayment I can think of.

24:13.640 --> 24:15.110
Help me put on the hood.

24:18.430 --> 24:20.640
They're just following orders.

24:20.680 --> 24:22.270
If they see my face,

24:24.660 --> 24:25.790
it'll be dangerous.

25:20.930 --> 25:22.720
It's time to say goodbye.

25:30.600 --> 25:32.750
I hope Dark Sword's Zhang Zheng

25:33.920 --> 25:36.050
will be a decisive person.

26:14.070 --> 26:15.930
Are you entrusted by Young Master

26:16.560 --> 26:18.090
to take care of Qingmu Yuan?

26:19.960 --> 26:20.880
Yes.

26:25.860 --> 26:26.930
Then why...

26:28.590 --> 26:30.720
after you became the real Zhang Zheng,

26:33.090 --> 26:34.820
you were ignoring Qingmu Yuan?

26:40.390 --> 26:42.920
Is it because Young Master liked Qingmu Yuan,

26:43.740 --> 26:45.200
and you dare not overstep?

26:47.270 --> 26:48.200
Yes.

26:50.360 --> 26:51.960
Then do you like Qingmu Yuan?

26:58.890 --> 27:01.180
Zhang Zheng, what's wrong with you?

27:01.640 --> 27:02.510
Zhang Zheng.

27:04.160 --> 27:05.580
Why is your face so hot?

27:06.350 --> 27:09.700
The smoke and formation should be harmless.

27:10.110 --> 27:10.920
Zhang Zheng.

27:11.390 --> 27:12.180
Zhang Zheng!

27:44.750 --> 27:46.950
Fortunately, I brought my Qiankun Bag.

27:47.240 --> 27:49.100
I've finally healed your wounds.

27:51.960 --> 27:52.960
I like.

27:58.550 --> 27:59.510
What do you like?

28:01.830 --> 28:03.480
I like Qingmu Yuan.

28:07.820 --> 28:09.370
Such quick response,

28:09.550 --> 28:11.280
just like when you were a child.

28:18.470 --> 28:21.600
Then let me ask you a question.

28:23.760 --> 28:27.790
Can Zhang Zheng and Qingmu Yuan be together forever?

28:29.030 --> 28:29.750
No.

28:31.440 --> 28:32.690
Why not?

28:33.600 --> 28:34.660
I'll ask you again.

28:34.680 --> 28:35.880
Answer me carefully.

28:36.680 --> 28:40.160
Can Zhang Zheng and Qingmu Yuan be together forever?

28:43.000 --> 28:43.720
No.

28:44.070 --> 28:45.000
Why not?

29:00.490 --> 29:01.740
Right now...

29:02.940 --> 29:04.380
you're in a dream.

29:05.870 --> 29:07.070
In this dream,

29:09.440 --> 29:11.170
do you dare to kiss Qingmu Yuan?

29:52.010 --> 29:53.980
♪ How can the wind stop? ♪

29:54.640 --> 29:57.020
♪ How can clouds stop for us? ♪

29:57.770 --> 30:01.320
♪ The vicissitudes of life never cease ♪

30:02.280 --> 30:06.960
♪ The time we spend together is too short and unreal ♪

30:07.910 --> 30:11.930
♪ You blur into a shadow near me ♪

30:13.020 --> 30:15.010
♪ We're fully committed ♪

30:15.560 --> 30:17.360
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

30:18.390 --> 30:22.270
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

30:22.350 --> 30:23.350
Qingmu Yuan?

30:22.730 --> 30:25.050
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

30:25.670 --> 30:27.900
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

30:28.940 --> 30:33.030
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

30:35.230 --> 30:39.670
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

30:40.310 --> 30:42.870
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

30:43.330 --> 30:45.290
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

30:46.060 --> 30:47.890
♪ Time goes by ♪

30:46.140 --> 30:47.530
Those who love you

30:48.560 --> 30:50.450
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

30:48.560 --> 30:50.740
will want you to live for yourself.

30:51.280 --> 30:54.660
♪ But our love remains still ♪

30:56.240 --> 31:00.620
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

31:01.520 --> 31:03.910
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

31:04.790 --> 31:06.690
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

31:07.430 --> 31:09.090
♪ The past vanishes ♪

31:09.630 --> 31:11.350
♪ Like a dream and a whiff of smoke ♪

31:12.280 --> 31:16.190
♪ I hope to see you again in the next life, if there is one ♪

31:28.030 --> 31:30.270
My Lady, breakfast is ready.

31:34.050 --> 31:36.680
My Lady, why are you up so early today?

31:44.960 --> 31:48.640
My Lady... did you go and meet Master Zhang Zheng?

31:49.750 --> 31:50.510
I did.

31:53.880 --> 31:54.910
I also got to know

31:55.680 --> 31:57.010
he has never let me down.

31:58.270 --> 32:01.550
Then... why do you look so troubled?

32:03.400 --> 32:05.060
Because I finally understand

32:05.490 --> 32:07.420
why Zhang Zhe became who he is today

32:07.830 --> 32:09.400
after he turned 18.

32:10.540 --> 32:12.730
Why did he suppress all his desires

32:13.350 --> 32:14.880
and live like an ascetic?

32:16.880 --> 32:18.510
Why he doesn't rest or sleep,

32:19.240 --> 32:23.040
and in just five years, mastered the second-best sword in the world?

32:23.920 --> 32:24.830
Why...

32:26.650 --> 32:28.240
he refuses to see me again?

32:28.830 --> 32:29.830
So why?

32:33.440 --> 32:36.510
Because someone sacrificed everything for him,

32:38.030 --> 32:40.160
but that instead became his shackles.

32:41.020 --> 32:43.730
He feels he cannot enjoy life,

32:44.760 --> 32:46.310
cannot stop running,

32:47.350 --> 32:48.680
and cannot let down

32:50.310 --> 32:52.240
that person's past expectations.

32:53.710 --> 32:55.410
But the most infuriating thing is,

32:55.410 --> 32:56.690
there is someone

32:57.200 --> 32:59.240
who wants to use this secret to blackmail him,

32:59.240 --> 33:01.770
forcing him to do things he doesn't want to do.

33:08.030 --> 33:09.110
Just kill me.

33:14.270 --> 33:15.790
I'm already exhausted.

33:20.110 --> 33:22.770
Miss Huaizhu, Master Zhang requests to see you.

33:24.590 --> 33:26.320
He is finally willing to see me?

33:33.960 --> 33:36.350
Master Zhang, you are indeed a rare guest.

33:42.520 --> 33:46.160
[Those who love you will want you to live for yourself.]

33:46.790 --> 33:47.750
Great words.

33:48.000 --> 33:49.000
As expected of me.

33:49.200 --> 33:51.400
What exactly did you do to me last night?

33:52.350 --> 33:53.790
Watch your words.

33:54.640 --> 33:56.800
You had a high fever last night and suddenly fainted.

33:56.800 --> 33:58.530
Of course, I gave you medicine.

33:58.600 --> 33:59.320
That's all?

34:00.270 --> 34:01.270
If not, what else?

34:02.790 --> 34:04.190
Then why, after I woke up,

34:05.240 --> 34:07.290
I can't seem to remember many things?

34:07.290 --> 34:09.420
That was an intoxicant made by Quzhuo.

34:09.440 --> 34:10.980
It's only natural you don't remember anything

34:10.980 --> 34:12.440
after being intoxicated.

34:12.630 --> 34:13.510
Ms. Qingmu.

34:15.400 --> 34:17.659
You had such a high fever last night,

34:18.070 --> 34:20.710
isn't it normal to forget some things?

34:23.080 --> 34:24.900
[Those who love you will want you to live for yourself.]

34:23.710 --> 34:25.110
Then what does this mean?

34:32.429 --> 34:34.730
How many years has it been since

34:35.370 --> 34:36.830
since we were classmates?

34:42.880 --> 34:45.239
Why are you bringing up something pointless?

34:45.239 --> 34:46.730
When we were classmates,

34:46.920 --> 34:48.650
you were also a man of few words,

34:49.690 --> 34:52.090
but at the very least, you were living life.

34:53.000 --> 34:54.600
What exactly happened to you

34:55.360 --> 34:57.220
that made you abandon all desires

34:57.590 --> 34:59.150
and live like an ascetic?

35:00.230 --> 35:01.070
What exactly?

35:13.320 --> 35:14.320
Those who love you

35:15.190 --> 35:17.120
will want you to live for yourself.

35:18.150 --> 35:19.510
The meaning is literal.

35:21.520 --> 35:22.490
Qingmu Yuan.

35:23.070 --> 35:24.630
Is it fun to tease me?

35:25.030 --> 35:26.960
Not calling me Ms. Qingmu anymore?

35:37.070 --> 35:38.280
I'm not teasing you.

35:39.440 --> 35:41.440
As classmates, we are also friends.

35:43.230 --> 35:44.400
I hope you...

35:45.710 --> 35:46.970
can live for yourself.

35:58.880 --> 35:59.760
Goodbye.

36:06.190 --> 36:06.920
Zhang Zheng.

36:07.670 --> 36:08.360
I'm sorry

36:10.030 --> 36:12.920
for uncovering your scars without your consent.

36:14.230 --> 36:15.550
I will keep this secret

36:16.550 --> 36:19.030
until I help you overcome all obstacles.

36:28.660 --> 36:30.860
The message from Prince Bumu to Hongye.

36:31.190 --> 36:32.840
This dessert shop below

36:32.860 --> 36:35.060
is the base of the National Preceptor's spies.

36:35.060 --> 36:37.190
Then which ones do you think are spies?

36:37.960 --> 36:40.080
Is it the beautiful Madam,

36:40.760 --> 36:43.000
or the one who drank eight bowls of dessert

36:43.000 --> 36:45.000
and has never moved from their seat?

36:46.230 --> 36:46.880
Puppy Li.

36:47.440 --> 36:48.800
Call me sister

36:48.840 --> 36:50.770
and I'll tell you who the spies are.

36:52.000 --> 36:52.670
You?

36:53.510 --> 36:54.640
I don't believe you.

36:55.000 --> 36:57.680
Since I was a child, I've been following Huaizhu to collect herbs and heal the sick.

36:57.680 --> 36:59.430
I've seen all sorts of people.

36:59.760 --> 37:01.840
No one can escape my discerning eye.

37:02.880 --> 37:04.320
Come on, call me sister

37:04.400 --> 37:05.930
and I'll analyze it for you.

37:07.810 --> 37:08.400
Sister.

37:08.590 --> 37:09.320
Beg me.

37:15.760 --> 37:16.800
Please.

37:19.320 --> 37:20.200
Look.

37:21.000 --> 37:23.800
That man who drank eight bowls of dessert

37:24.140 --> 37:26.680
has been staring at that beautiful Madam.

37:26.880 --> 37:28.680
He's probably just a womanizer.

37:29.920 --> 37:31.500
As for that Madam,

37:31.590 --> 37:32.850
she's very beautiful,

37:33.280 --> 37:35.510
yet she's running a small dessert shop.

37:35.630 --> 37:37.030
It is indeed suspicious.

37:37.230 --> 37:38.440
But have you noticed that

37:38.440 --> 37:40.170
she has never stood up?

37:42.440 --> 37:44.420
There's something wrong with her left leg.

37:44.420 --> 37:45.740
She's disabled.

37:46.030 --> 37:47.560
Then it can't be her either.

37:48.300 --> 37:50.630
The most suspicious ones in the whole shop

37:50.650 --> 37:52.650
are actually those two assistants.

37:53.530 --> 37:54.400
Two bowls of dessert!

37:54.400 --> 37:56.440
One of them is always slacking off.

37:56.600 --> 37:58.130
It's such a small shop.

37:58.190 --> 38:00.110
Even if it's profitable every day,

38:00.110 --> 38:02.640
can she really afford to hire two assistants?

38:03.690 --> 38:06.760
Maybe he's the Madam's demon?

38:06.780 --> 38:08.710
What kind of demon dares to be lazy?

38:09.940 --> 38:11.080
Let's go, Puppy Li.

38:11.190 --> 38:12.440
Let's go down and meet him.
